  - Whole Building Hollow Shell added Wall Thickness to 3 open surface component(s)
    and preserved the authored thickness of 0 closed volumetric component(s).
  - 'Shell breakdown (triangles, volume, watertight): #1 16 tri, vol 141,257, OPEN;
